      "The Layer2Concept adds a required gene_flow_model field to bound Population records and adds a typed relation type REPRODUCTIVE_BOUNDARY_WITH.",
      "The same concept adds required exchange_scope to the GENE_FLOW_WITH relation schema."
    ]
